      "2026": "Main pp. 1,7–8,11 and Fig. 4: source-reported Cr 92.51%,Cu 86.91%,Ni 91.25%,8 min,45 C,400 rpm,10 g/L. SI Table S2 final PLS: Cr 829.6,Cu 583,Ni 1043.65 ppm; full fourteen-element table present.",
