      "2026": "Main pp. 9–10 Fig.5 and SI S5 assign hydronium-jarosite-containing residues, stronger at higher temperatures, and surface-composition changes. SI Table S3 contains calculated reaction free energies.",
      "disposition": "Preserve source-assigned phases and 2024 temperature conflict. SEM/EDS, XRD and calculated thermodynamics do not alone prove Cr/Cu/Ni lattice incorporation, rate control, or complete metal mass balance. Similar-looking microscopy is not proof of physical batch/image identity."
    },
    {
