      "2024": "Main pp. 4,9 Fig.6: TCLP Ni 59.7→25 mg/L versus plotted 5; Cr 11.6→4 versus 12. SPLP Ni 17.8→7.2 with threshold n.s.; Cr 5.8→2 versus 5. Feed pH 8.3→fluid 2; residue pH 5.1 then acid/heat treatment pH 4.47→fluid 1.",
      "2026": "Main pp. 4,10 and SI S6a/b images 9/10: TCLP Ni 59.7→13.9 mg/L versus 5; Cr 11.6→1 versus 12. SPLP Ni 17.8→4.1 with threshold n.s.; Cr 5.82→1.6 versus 5. Feed pH 8.3→fluid 2, residue pH 3.55→fluid 1.",
